# Line endings are load-bearing in this project:
#   * .cmd MUST be CRLF - cmd.exe mis-parses ( ) blocks when they are LF-only
#   * everything else is LF, matching what build.py writes, so a fresh clone
#     reproduces dist/ byte for byte
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Keep the generated installer out of diffs-as-noise only where it is binary;
# it is text, so leave it diffable.
